# Docker build context hygiene: the builder installs and compiles INSIDE the
# image, so host-side artifacts must never leak in (size + stale-code safety).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# The filled deploy environment holds production secrets — never let it into
# an image layer, even though no Dockerfile COPYs it.
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.*
!deploy/.env.example
